# A change to these paths needs a review from a plugin owner: they define what every agent and
# page does, the checks that hold them to docs/STANDARD.md, and the standard itself. The develop
# branch protection requires a code-owner review (docs/PLUGIN-LIFECYCLE.md section 11). Either
# owner's approval is enough.

/plugins/*/agents/      @iteration @payman-salimi
/plugins/*/skills/      @iteration @payman-salimi
/scripts/               @iteration @payman-salimi
/docs/STANDARD.md       @iteration @payman-salimi
/.github/               @iteration @payman-salimi
